        sourceType = "Achievement",
        stepCount = 6,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Many dungeon, raid and world-boss kills with the correct Pepe buff.\n\n1. In your own Draenor Garrison, target Pepe and click him in his tree to obtain the one-hour Pepe buff. At level 1 he is by the Alliance command tent or beyond the Horde eastern wall; at level 2 near the flight master; at level 3 among the trees beside the buildings near the Town Hall. Fly or jump and use Interact With Target to reach him.\n\n2. Track achievement 9838 and keep the original Garrison Pepe buff for each required boss kill. Death or expiry removes it, so return for Pepe before continuing. Previously earned boss criteria stay complete; all kills do not have to fit into one hour or one run. A random travelling Pepe elsewhere is not a reliable substitute for this buff.\n\n3. With Pepe, defeat the final boss of each original Draenor dungeon: Gug'rokk (Bloodmaul Slag Mines), Skulloc (Iron Docks), Teron'gor (Auchindoun), Ner'zhul (Shadowmoon Burial Grounds), High Sage Viryx (Skyreach), Skylord Tovra (Grimrail Depot), Yalnu (The Everbloom) and Warlord Zaela (Upper Blackrock Spire). Normal qualifies for achievement credit. Let Zaela finish her introductory roleplay before attacking.\n\n4. With Pepe, clear all seven Highmaul encounters (Kargath, The Butcher, Brackenspore, Tectus, Twin Ogron, Ko'ragh and Imperator Mar'gok) and all ten Blackrock Foundry encounters (Gruul, Oregorger, Blast Furnace, Hans'gar/Franzok, Flamebender Ka'graz, Kromog, Beastlord Darmac, Operator Thogar, Iron Maidens and Blackhand). Use the achievement's missing criteria to avoid needless repeat clears.\n\n5. With Pepe, tag and defeat Drov the Ruiner and Tarlna the Ageless in Gorgrond, and Rukhmar in Spires of Arak. Check both Gorgrond boss sites; these bosses rotate spawns, so wait for the missing one. Achievement credit is separate from your weekly loot entitlement.\n\n6. After every missing criterion is complete, check the Toy Box. Later Retail reports confirm that the whistle is added automatically; do not wait indefinitely for a mailed item. Pepe costumes are separate character unlocks and are not extra criteria for this whistle.",
