        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Six different rare summoning items or invitations to their summoned bosses.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Six different rare summoning items or invitations to their summoned bosses.\n\n1. Use a level 3 Garrison and trigger the missing faction's invasion using its associated assault. Botani gives Teluur (item 122466); Ogre gives Mage Lord Gogg'nathog (122474); Goren gives Gaur (122468); Iron Horde gives Commander Dro'gan (122472); Shadow Council gives Lady Fleshsear (122473); Shadowmoon gives Annihilon (122475).\n\n2. Finish invasions repeatedly for a chance at the corresponding summoning item. Items can drop at any successful rating and after your first invasion of the week; the weekly bag restriction does not stop these drops. Bring two helpers to provide up to three independent drop chances, respecting the three-player limit corrected in the replies.\n\n3. When someone obtains a summoning item, assemble everyone who needs the boss in a level 3 Garrison, then use the item and defeat that named boss. Summoning consumes the item. You may join another person's summon and receive kill credit without owning a stone.\n\n4. Repeat until all six named bosses are credited. You can gain achievement credit from more than one DIFFERENT boss in a week even when boss loot is already locked. Do not copy old estimates promising all stones in nine hours: modern reports include dozens of invasions for one item.",
