        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Exploration mission offers are random and repeatable.\n\n1. Train at least basic Archaeology on a character with an unlocked Garrison mission table. Develop followers able to succeed at the missions. You do not need the old maximum Archaeology skill just to see offers.\n\n2. Check for Exploration missions naturally, including on your Archaeology-trained alts. Optional acceleration: buy Explorer's Notebook for five Restored Artifacts at the Archaeology vendor in Stormshield/Warspear and use it to generate an eligible mission. The old Pandaria Spirit of Harmony-to-Restored Artifact exchange was removed.\n\n3. Complete the offered mission successfully and claim it. Check each distinct named criterion and continue until all are complete; duplicates can occur. Buying a fixed batch of notebooks is not a guaranteed unique set, so use them one at a time.\n\n4. Complete existing Exploration offers to allow later ones to appear. This achievement is NOT required for Harrison Jones: that old claim was corrected in the replies.",
