        difficultyReason = "Finish five complete zone story achievements.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Finish five complete zone story achievements.\n\n1. Track the Horde Loremaster of Draenor checklist. Complete Frostfire Ridge, Gorgrond, Talador, Spires of Arak and Nagrand. Tanaan's later campaign is not a sixth requirement.\n\n2. Open the missing zone achievement for its chapter starts and quest progress. Continue one character's actual unfinished quests; account chapter credit and another character's local quest flags are separate.\n\n3. In Gorgrond and Talador complete the branch for your selected outpost. In Spires do Pinchwhistle Gearworks and Admiral Taylor's Garrison as well as the arakkoa story. In Nagrand finish the Lok-rath / Garrosh finale after the other required hubs.\n\n4. When all five zone achievements are credited, the meta completes and advances Draenor Pathfinder. You can already use modern Draenor flight without earning Pathfinder.",
